> would that going to slow down the machine
> signifigcantly?
> 
> And, I don't suppose these RECOMPILED apps.
> are considered as Alpha native apps. ...


When you recompile them on Alpha, they are now native
Alpha applications.  (ie. Native Alpha Machine Code)
Now if you rewrite them with the Alpha in mind, they
will probably run a little faster.

As for recompiling with NO changes, that is the hope,
but probably not the reality.  

