Three possible solutions:
1 - recompile your Milo, or get someone to do it for you.  You can
    configure milo's serial port behavior at compile time.
2 - Use a PS/2 mouse.  Or a serial-PS/2 converter -- PS/2-serial converters
    exist, why not the other way?
3 - buy or build a splitter to allow you to put your (mouse|modem) on ttyS1
    instead of ttyS0.

