I don't appreciate whatever motive you may have had in contacting
my postmaster.

I mung addresses on news postings I submit, in an attempt to avoid
receiving spam.  It is my personal choice and it is something my
University does not have a problem with.  I do not recognize your
authority to tell me otherwise.  If you want to remove my postings site
wide, that is your perogative (personally, I don't give a damn what you do
